@dsh-external/dsh-llm-approver README · from a clone of this repo:：Each script edits the profile's `package.json` (bundle + dependency, keeping
both lists intact), runs `pnpm install`, verifies the composed tree, and
prints the restart reminder. Both are idempotent.

